WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,930
I have been doing food programs for so many years

2
00:00:01,930 --> 00:00:03,490
Unexpectedly, after living on a desert island,

3
00:00:03,490 --> 00:00:05,970
A piece of salted mutton makes me miserable

4
00:00:05,970 --> 00:00:08,730
Now I even want to apologize for the lunch boxes that I disliked before

5
00:00:08,730 --> 00:00:10,490
Do you often eat here?

6
00:00:10,490 --> 00:00:11,810
We were grabbing meat just now

7
00:00:11,810 --> 00:00:13,490
The way you four look at us

8
00:00:13,490 --> 00:00:15,290
A bit like a pitiful pair

9
00:00:15,290 --> 00:00:17,130
Lu Shutang even gave me his own meat

10
00:00:17,130 --> 00:00:18,490
He used to be the fastest hungry

11
00:00:19,210 --> 00:00:20,130
Thinking too much

12
00:00:20,130 --> 00:00:22,330
I just have a bad appetite today, that's right

13
00:00:22,330 --> 00:00:27,680
We are all miserable in the dormitory

14
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:29,160
Can we do any more work?

15
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:30,400
Take back some meat in exchange for it

16
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:31,720
No extra work today

17
00:00:31,720 --> 00:00:32,840
Not at all

18
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:34,120
your work today

19
00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:35,480
I've already eaten enough to clear the air

20
00:00:35,480 --> 00:00:36,640
Take more temporarily

21
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:43,520
It's just another deal. I understand that you can't bring meat with you.

22
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:45,320
Grapes are a small reward for your cooperation today.

23
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:46,960
Fruit is fine too

24
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:48,640
Why would you rather we have enough to eat?

25
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:50,320
And they don’t want us to take the meat back to the camp.

26
00:00:50,320 --> 00:00:52,320
Because I will need more people to work in the future
